  "ingredients": [
    "16 ounce sirloin steak",
    "1/4 cup soy sauce",
    "2 tablespoon lemon juice (or Calamansi)",
    "6 teaspoon garlic (minced)",
    "3 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "1 tablespoon erythritol",
    "1 cup coconut oil",
    "16 ounce cauliflower rice",
    "4 large egg"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Combine soy, citrus, garlic, sweetener, garlic powder, salt, and pepper in a bowl. Stir until the sweetener and salt are dissolved.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-breakfast-bowl/#wprm-recipe-52854-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/keto-steak-and-egg-breakfast-bowl-01-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place beef into a Ziploc bag and pour in marinade. Refrigerate overnight to cure.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-breakfast-bowl/#wprm-recipe-52854-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/keto-steak-and-egg-breakfast-bowl-04-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "The next day, remove meat from marinade. Pre-heat a frying pan on your stove. Coat pan with coconut oil.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-breakfast-bowl/#wprm-recipe-52854-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/keto-steak-and-egg-breakfast-bowl-05-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add a single layer of beef slices and fry, turning on sides, until all liquid is almost absorbed.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-breakfast-bowl/#wprm-recipe-52854-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/keto-steak-and-egg-breakfast-bowl-06-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove beef from the pan. Allow the beef to cool before slicing it into strips.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-breakfast-bowl/#wprm-recipe-52854-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/keto-steak-and-egg-breakfast-bowl-07-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add remaining coconut oil and minced garlic to the pan.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-breakfast-bowl/#wprm-recipe-52854-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/keto-steak-and-egg-breakfast-bowl-09-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir salt and garlic powder into oil then add the garlic mince. Sauté until aromatic.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-breakfast-bowl/#wprm-recipe-52854-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/keto-steak-and-egg-breakfast-bowl-10-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in cauliflower rice, toss to coat evenly.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-breakfast-bowl/#wprm-recipe-52854-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/keto-steak-and-egg-breakfast-bowl-11-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook until tender and almost dry. Season with remaining garlic powder and black pepper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-breakfast-bowl/#wprm-recipe-52854-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/keto-steak-and-egg-breakfast-bowl-12-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate pan, fry eggs to desired consistency.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-breakfast-bowl/#wprm-recipe-52854-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/keto-steak-and-egg-breakfast-bowl-13-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove cauliflower rice and eggs from pans; serve with beef strips and your favorite toppings.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-breakfast-bowl/#wprm-recipe-52854-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
